        "value": "Editorial head-note printed in the top margin, in two small sub-columns read right-first: '(vermilion in the original) sotsu class — not known.' （原朱）is this edition's marker that the note stood in vermilion ink in the manuscript being reproduced; the same qualifier opens the head-note on the facing leaf (（原朱）庚午四月ノ調ニ據ル, p.109). The note records that the figure for the sotsu (lower-samurai) class was not ascertained, and no 卒族 column is printed anywhere on this page — the one gap in the domain's status return. An absence note, not a value."
      },
